cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use auto16s in your work, please cite it as below, together with the tools it runs (see the Citations section of the README)."
type: software
title: "auto16s: automated analysis of paired-end 16S rRNA amplicon data"
abstract: >-
  A Nextflow pipeline that takes paired-end 16S rRNA amplicon reads from raw FASTQ files to diversity
  statistics, differential abundance results and a written report. It detects and removes primers and
  adapters, chooses truncation lengths and rarefaction depth from the data, infers ASVs with DADA2,
  assigns taxonomy against SILVA, and runs phyloseq, vegan and MaAsLin 3 analyses.
authors:
